      "committer": {
        "name": "Mike Kinney",
        "email": "mike.kinney@gmail.com",
        "date": "2026-11-22T12:00:24Z"
      },
      "message": "feat(app): saved cut recipes - apply an operation's settings to new geometry\n\nA cut recipe holds an operation's kind and parameters, its tool by name\nand the workpiece material in force. Recipes live in a user library file\n(recipes.camrecipes, camcraft-recipes/1 envelope; CAMCRAFT_RECIPES or the\nplatform data folder).\n\nApplyCutRecipe makes a new operation from a recipe on new geometry as one\nundoable step. It wraps CreateOperation, so every creation gate applies.\nIt refuses, by the recipe's name, a tool that is not in the document, a\nmaterial word the table does not know, and a material other than the\nmaterial in force.\n\nMCP tools: save_cut_recipe, list_cut_recipes, apply_cut_recipe.\n\nFixes #3073\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
