      "message": "fix(app): refuse cut recipes with saved per-corner relief overrides\n\nA per-corner relief override holds a source corner XY. ApplyCutRecipe\nnow refuses a Pocket, Adaptive2D or Offset2D recipe that has one, with\nthe recipe name. A recipe with only the global relief kind still applies.\n\nRefs #3073\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
