      "message": "fix(app): cut recipe refuses saved waterjet tab positions\n\nMain added OpParams::WaterjetProfile (#3058). The exhaustive match in\nhas_saved_geometry did not cover it, so the merge with main did not compile.\nA tab position is a world X, Y of the source contour: ApplyCutRecipe now\nrefuses a recipe whose tabs.at is not empty. A waterjet recipe without tab\npositions applies.\n\nRefs #3073\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
